2. Check that pasting Alpha\r\nBeta displays two lines without a visible carriage-return artifact.
3. Confirm that editing text in a bound container updates the editor to the measured width and height, including when the text is a single line.
4. Test editing text in Firefox and Safari and confirm that text aligned to a container edge is not clipped by the editor.
5. Check that increasing the shape's height without changing its available text width does not change the bound text's font size.

Test areas:
