  * Check that pasting Alpha\r\nBeta displays two lines without a visible carriage-return artifact.
  * Confirm that editing text in a bound container updates the editor to the measured width and height, including when the text is a single line.
  * Test editing text in Firefox and Safari and confirm that text aligned to a container edge is not clipped by the editor.
- Bound-text resizing (setup: Prepare a shape with bound text and a multi-line label.)
  * Check that increasing the shape's height without changing its available text width does not change the bound text's font size.
  * Verify that narrowing the shape causes its bound text to wrap within the available width and that the text remains visible.
- Canvas display and image export (setup: Prepare a drawing with multi-line text, including text aligned to the bottom of a shape.)
  * Verify that multi-line text remains visible and is positioned from the bottom baseline of each line on the canvas.
  * Confirm that SVG and canvas image exports show the text without clipping and with the lines positioned within their text area.

